Add, keeping `present(_:)` for other callers:
```swift
/// A cover waiting for the root sheet (and anything stacked on it) to finish dismissing.
@ObservationIgnored private(set) var pendingCover: AppCover?

/// Presents `cover` from the root: at once when no root sheet is up, else once it has gone (RootView's sheet onDismiss).
/// SwiftUI presents one modal per presenter and would otherwise hold the cover until the sheet closes.
func presentCoverAfterDismissingSheet(_ cover: AppCover) {
    if sheet != nil { pendingCover = cover; sheet = nil } else { self.cover = cover }
}

func presentPendingCover() {
    guard let next = pendingCover else { return }
    pendingCover = nil
    cover = next
}
```
Also set `pendingCover = nil` in `present(_ sheet: AppSheet)` so a stale pending cover never fires after a later sheet.

